From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Haze <patches@haze.invalid>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:41:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Use a placeholder Haze icon instead of Chromium's logo

Why: Until the real icon lands in step 30, a neutral square with an "H" keeps
Chromium's logo off Haze's windows, taskbar, About page and desktop entries.
scripts/placeholder_icon.py in the Haze repo draws every file byte for byte.
The macOS asset catalog (Assets.car) needs Apple's actool and stays as it is.
Profile shortcut icons on Windows are bumped to version 11 so existing ones are
regenerated, as chrome/app/theme/chromium/win/README asks.
Security-relevant: no
Area: core
